    "message": "Import the Anthropic SDK at the first API call\n\nA router in record mode built its Anthropic provider, and imported the\noptional SDK, before a test or a usage account replaced the provider, so\ntests failed where only the dev dependencies were installed. The provider\nnow imports the SDK when it first calls the API, and reports a missing SDK\nas such rather than as a failed request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
